    {
      "Original": "Flips a \"IsInside\" boolean the game checks before running their new culling algorithm.\nThis has the side benefit of re-enabling void lighting.",
      "Context": "FakeOutside..ctor",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SetTooltip",
      "Translated": "反转游戏在运行新剔除算法前检查的 IsInside 布尔值。\n同时可重新启用虚空区域的光照。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Hooks the culling function and changes the Draw Object's visibility value.\nThis does not fix light culling, and may have other issues.",
      "Context": "HookAndChange..ctor",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGui.SetTooltip",
      "Translated": "钩取剔除函数并修改绘制对象的可见性值。\n此方法不会修复光照剔除，且可能存在其他问题。",
